### 3. Cek hasil
GET {{sl}}/PaymentTermsTypes?$select=GroupNumber,PaymentTermsGroupName,NumberOfAdditionalDays
Prefer: odata.maxpagesize=200

### 4. Logout
POST {{sl}}/Logout
